sequenceDiagram
    title 1. Agent Startup and Initialization
    
    participant User
    participant Agent as SparkAgent
    participant Config as ConfigurationManager
    participant Manager as SparkManager
    participant Proxy as SparkProxy
    participant API as ApiServer
    participant Flow as FlowControl
    participant Scheduler
    
    User->>Agent: Start Agent
    Agent->>Agent: Initialize components
    
    Note over Agent: Configuration Phase
    Agent->>Config: Initialize configuration
    Config->>Manager: GET /api/configuration
    Manager-->>Config: Default configuration
    Config->>Config: Save local config
    Config-->>Agent: Configuration ready
    
    Note over Agent: Dependency Check
    Agent->>Manager: Health check
    Manager-->>Agent: Healthy
    Agent->>Proxy: Health check
    Proxy-->>Agent: Healthy
    
    Note over Agent: Service Startup
    Agent->>API: Start API server (port 3000)
    Agent->>Flow: Initialize FlowControl
    Agent->>Scheduler: Create scheduler (continuous/interval)
    Agent->>Agent: Start link monitoring
    
    Note over Agent: Ready State
    Agent-->>User: Agent started successfully
    
    rect rgb(200, 255, 200)
        Note over Agent: Agent is now ready to process messages
    end